            "",
            "Imperfect",
            "Preterite"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "affirmative",
              "quería = _wanted_",
              "quise = _tried to, set out to_"
            ],
            [
              "negative",
              "no quería = _didn't want to_",
              "no quise = _refused to_"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The **imperfect** describes the desire. The **preterite** turns it into an action: an attempt, or a refusal."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **no quiso** slams the door; **no quería** just didn't feel like it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
